1784335611.713 RX Newhaven, Village Entrance
1784335611.713 RX     Welcome to Newhaven! You are standing at the crude wooden gates of the
1784335611.713 RX village entrance, in the middle of a dusty path. A low wooden palisade
1784335611.713 RX surrounds the village, to protect against creatures of the night and random
1784335611.713 RX raiders. You can see small buildings to the north and south, and a dusty path
1784335611.713 RX that leads to the west and southeast. 
1784335611.713 RX You notice large sign, newbie manual here.
