1784335612.840 RX     The trees become very thick around you now, and you can barely see where
1784335612.840 RX you're going due to the only light source being from the village behind you and
1784335612.840 RX the light shining through the trees. You hear the sound of rippling water south
1784335612.840 RX of here. 
