1784335614.045 RX Newhaven, Docks
1784335614.045 RX     You stand at the southernmost edge of Newhaven. The view from here is
1784335614.045 RX amazing. As you stare out across the Silver river you behold such sights as the
1784335614.045 RX notorious Port Blackwater to the west, and the fabled town of Silvermere
1784335614.045 RX southwards. A large half-shaven man sits off in the corner, with what looks to
1784335614.045 RX be a fishing rod, and there are a number of small skiffs tied to the dock for
1784335614.045 RX use in reaching the docks of Silvermere. 
1784335614.045 RX Also here: ferryman.
1784335614.045 RX Obvious exits: north
