1784335662.254 RX Mystic Alley
1784335662.255 RX     This is a wide, well-lit alleyway. It is very clean and well-kept, and
1784335662.255 RX looks like it is regularly maintained. This is strange, since you can see no
1784335662.255 RX apparent source of light, and as you look closer, you can see not even the
1784335662.255 RX smallest particle of debris! The houses around you are all tall and
1784335662.255 RX rickety-looking, and you could swear that some houses just change places when
1784335662.255 RX you're not looking. The alleyway exits onto a street to the north, and
1784335662.255 RX continues to the south. 
